2026-05-17 04:01:44.570 [info] Received message from webview: {"type":"request","requestId":"jwncswyvqzr","request":{"type":"open_markdown_preview","channelId":"a0xkjxb8vju","content":"# AI_Workflow Orchestration Hub — Full Setup Plan\n\n## Context\n\nAbdullah has a vision: one folder (`/home/dev/AI_Workflow/`) where all AI tools (Claude Code, OpenCode, Ollama, Antigravity, Copilot, and future OpenClaw) are centralized and orchestrated. The structure already exists partially — OpenCode's config is symlinked from `~/opencode.json`, the MCP servers work, and PAOS is defined. But Claude Code's config is still at `~/.claude/` (not linked), Antigravity is at `~/.config/Antigravity/`, and there's no dashboard to visualize the orchestration.\n\n**Goals:**\n1. Set up symlinks so all AI tools operate from AI_Workflow\n2. Fix OpenCode's PAOS to inherit Antigravity's Review Loop properly\n3. Build a Next.js dashboard to visualize orchestration, agents, logs, tasks, and plans\n4. Make space for future OpenClaw installation\n\n---\n\n## Part 1: Symlinks & Centralization\n\n### Claude Code\n- Move `~/.claude/mcp.json` → `AI_Workflow/config/claude/mcp.json` (symlink back)\n- Move `~/.claude/settings.json` → `AI_Workflow/config/claude/settings.json` (symlink back)\n- Keep `~/.claude/.claude.json` and `~/.claude/.credentials.json` in place (app state + secrets)\n- Symlink `~/.claude/projects/` → `AI_Workflow/config/claude/projects/` (project configs)\n\n### OpenCode\n- Already done: `~/opencode.json` → `AI_Workflow/config/opencode/opencode.json` ✓\n- Symlink `~/.config/opencode/opencode.json` → `AI_Workflow/config/opencode/opencode.json`\n- Symlink `~/.config/opencode/AGENTS.md` → `AI_Workflow/config/opencode/AGENTS.md`\n\n### Antigravity (VS Code variant)\n- Symlink `~/.config/Antigravity/User/settings.json` → `AI_Workflow/config/antigravity/settings.json`\n- Symlink `~/.config/Antigravity/User/keybindings.json` → `AI_Workflow/config/antigravity/keybindings.json`\n- Keep extension storage in place (too large/volatile to move)\n\n### Ollama\n- Already has config at `AI_Workflow/config/ollama/config.json` ✓\n- Symlink `~/.ollama/config.json` → `AI_Workflow/config/ollama/config.json` (if ollama supports it)\n- Models stay at `~/.ollama/models/` (too large to move)\n\n### Copilot\n- Create `AI_Workflow/config/copilot/instructions.md` — shared instructions file\n- Copilot is a VS Code extension, config lives in VS Code settings (already handled via Antigravity)\n\n### OpenClaw (Future)\n- Create `AI_Workflow/config/openclaw/` placeholder with README\n- Create `AI_Workflow/agents/openclaw/` placeholder\n- Create `AI_Workflow/logs/openclaw/events.md`\n- Create `AI_Workflow/memory/inbox/openclaw/`\n\n---\n\n## Part 2: OpenCode PAOS — Inherit Antigravity Review Loop\n\nThe current OpenCode `plan` agent has a basic PAOS pipeline but doesn't fully implement the Antigravity Review Loop (Article VIII). Need to align it with the skill at `AI_Workflow/skills/antigravity-review-loop/SKILL.md`.\n\n### Changes to OpenCode config:\n1. Update `plan` agent prompt to reference the Antigravity Review Loop skill\n2. Add `architect` and `coordinator` agents to the OpenCode config\n3. Ensure the developer agent reads from `memory/prompts/` for handoffs\n4. Point `.opencode/workflow.md` instructions to the PAOS constitution\n\n### Files to modify:\n- `/home/dev/AI_Workflow/config/opencode/opencode.json` — add architect/coordinator agents\n- `/home/dev/.config/opencode/AGENTS.md` — ensure all 4 agents documented\n\n---\n\n## Part 3: Next.js Orchestration Dashboard\n\n### Location\n`/home/dev/AI_Workflow/dashboard/` — a Next.js app\n\n### Features\n1. **Agent Status Panel** — Shows each agent (developer, architect, coordinator, profiler, plan) with their last action and status\n2. **Global Ledger View** — Table of all audit entries from `global_ledger.md`, filterable by agent/action/date\n3. **Task Board** — Kanban-style view of tasks from `memory/tasks/`, grouped by status\n4. **Implementation Plans** — List and view `pm-logs/*-IMPLEMENTATION_PLAN.md` files with comment highlighting\n5. **Walkthrough Viewer** — Renders `WALKTHROUGH.md` files with syntax highlighting\n6. **Inbox/Messages** — View all agent inboxes, send messages between agents\n7. **Log Viewer** — Per-agent event logs with timestamps\n8. **AI Tool Launcher** — Buttons to launch OpenCode or Claude Code in terminal (via API/WebSocket)\n9. **Project Switcher** — Select active project from projects.md registry\n\n### Tech Stack\n- Next.js 14 (App Router)\n- Tailwind CSS + shadcn/ui\n- Server Actions to read/write markdown files from `AI_Workflow/`\n- WebSocket for live log tailing\n- No database — reads directly from the file-based memory system\n\n### API Routes\n- `GET /api/ledger` — Parse and return global_ledger.md as JSON\n- `GET /api/tasks` — List all task cards with YAML frontmatter parsed\n- `GET /api/agents` — Agent status from logs\n- `GET /api/plans` — List implementation plans from pm-logs/\n- `GET /api/inbox/:agent` — Read agent inbox\n- `POST /api/inbox/:agent` — Send message to agent\n- `GET /api/logs/:agent` — Read agent event log\n- `POST /api/launch/:tool` — Launch opencode/claude in terminal\n\n---\n\n## Part 4: Directory Structure After Setup\n\n```\n/home/dev/AI_Workflow/\n├── agents/                    (unchanged)\n├── bin/                       (opencode binary + future openclaw)\n├── config/\n│   ├── claude/\n│   │   ├── mcp.json          ← ~/.claude/mcp.json symlinks here\n│   │   ├── settings.json     ← ~/.claude/settings.json symlinks here\n│   │   └── projects/         ← ~/.claude/projects/ symlinks here\n│   ├── opencode/\n│   │   ├── opencode.json     ← ~/.config/opencode/opencode.json symlinks here\n│   │   └── AGENTS.md         ← ~/.config/opencode/AGENTS.md symlinks here\n│   ├── antigravity/\n│   │   ├── settings.json     ← ~/.config/Antigravity/User/settings.json symlinks here\n│   │   └── keybindings.json\n│   ├── ollama/\n│   │   └── config.json\n│   ├── copilot/\n│   │   └── instructions.md\n│   └── openclaw/             (placeholder)\n│       └── README.md\n├── dashboard/                 (NEW - Next.js app)\n│   ├── package.json\n│   ├── next.config.js\n│   ├── tailwind.config.js\n│   ├── app/\n│   │   ├── layout.tsx\n│   │   ├── page.tsx          (main dashboard)\n│   │   ├── agents/\n│   │   ├── tasks/\n│   │   ├── plans/\n│   │   ├── logs/\n│   │   └── api/\n│   ├── components/\n│   │   ├── AgentCard.tsx\n│   │   ├── LedgerTable.tsx\n│   │   ├── TaskBoard.tsx\n│   │   ├── PlanViewer.tsx\n│   │   └── InboxPanel.tsx\n│   └── lib/\n│       ├── parse-ledger.ts\n│       ├── parse-tasks.ts\n│       └── file-reader.ts\n├── knowledge/                 (unchanged)\n├── logs/                      (unchanged + openclaw/events.md)\n├── mcp/                       (unchanged)\n├── memory/ → logs/            (symlink, unchanged)\n├── skills/                    (unchanged)\n├── vault/                     (unchanged)\n├── workflows/                 (unchanged)\n├── CLAUDE.md\n├── workflow.md\n├── user.md\n└── package.json\n```\n\n---\n\n## Verification Plan\n\n1. **Symlinks**: After creating, verify each tool still works:\n   - `opencode --version` (already works)\n   - `claude --version` or run Claude Code\n   - Check Antigravity opens with correct settings\n2. **MCP Servers**: Run `opencode mcp list` and verify shared-memory appears\n3. **Dashboard**: `cd AI_Workflow/dashboard && npm run dev` → open localhost:3000\n4. **Cross-AI test**: Send message from dashboard → read in Claude Code → read in OpenCode\n5. **Review Loop test**: Trigger a plan in OpenCode → verify it produces TASKS.md + IMPLEMENTATION_PLAN.md → verify architect review gate works\n\n---\n\n## Execution Order\n\n1. Create symlinks (Claude, OpenCode, Antigravity, Ollama)\n2. Create OpenClaw placeholders\n3. Update OpenCode config with full PAOS agent roster\n4. Scaffold Next.js dashboard\n5. Build dashboard pages (ledger, tasks, plans, logs, inbox, launcher)\n6. Test end-to-end\n","title":"AI_Workflow Orchestration Hub — Full Setup Plan","enableComments":true}}
