2026-05-17 04:25:35.625 [info] Received message from webview: {"type":"response","requestId":"aaa73603d4d98241b61db807a15daefe","response":{"type":"tool_permission_response","result":{"behavior":"allow","updatedInput":{"file_path":"/home/dev/AI_Workflow/CLAUDE.md","content":"# PAOS — Personal Agent Operating System\n\nThis project is governed by the **PAOS Constitution** (`~/AI_Workflow/workflow.md`). You must read it before acting.\n\n## Identity\n- **Operator**: Abdullah Abdul Hakim — NodeAlgo (nodealgo.com)\n- **Full Profile**: `~/AI_Workflow/user.md`\n\n## Architecture\n\n```\n~/AI_Workflow/\n├── agents/         — Agent souls (developer, architect, coordinator, profiler)\n├── skills/         — Shareable skills (antigravity-review-loop, project-scaffolder, ...)\n├── knowledge/      — Canonical knowledge base (PAOS, references, templates)\n├── logs/           — Per-agent audit ledgers\n│   ├── global_ledger.md\n│   ├── developer/events.md\n│   ├── claude/events.md\n│   ├── openclaw/events.md\n│   └── ...\n├── memory/         — Shared memory (symlink → logs/)\n│   ├── shared/context.md     — Tier A: shared thinking context\n│   ├── tasks/                — Tier B: task board with YAML status\n│   ├── prompts/              — PM's handoff prompts for developer\n│   ├── pm-logs/              — PM's Antigravity artifacts (IMPLEMENTATION_PLAN, TASKS, WALKTHROUGH)\n│   ├── inbox/                — Tier C: agent messaging\n│   │   ├── developer/\n│   │   ├── architect/\n│   │   ├── coordinator/\n│   │   ├── claude/\n│   │   ├── openclaw/         — Reserved for OpenClaw AI\n│   │   └── ollama/\n│   └── global_ledger.md\n├── config/         — All AI tool configs (claude/, opencode/, antigravity/, openclaw/, ollama/, copilot/)\n├── mcp/            — MCP servers (shared-memory: send_message/read_inbox/append_ledger, scaffold)\n├── dashboard/      — Next.js orchestration dashboard (localhost:3333)\n├── vault/          — Obsidian vault (symlinked knowledge/ and memory/)\n└── workflows/      — PAOS workflow definitions\n```\n\n## Agent Pipeline\n```\nDeveloper → @plan (PM) → @architect + @coordinator (parallel review) → PM → Developer → Coordinator\n```\n\n## Active AI Agents\n| Agent | Tool | Config |\n|-------|------|--------|\n| Claude Code | `~/.claude` → `config/claude/` | This file |\n| OpenCode developer/plan | `~/.opencode` → `AI_Workflow/` | `config/opencode/opencode.json` |\n| Antigravity | `~/.antigravity` → `config/antigravity/` | VS Code extension |\n| OpenClaw | `config/openclaw/` (reserved) | `config/openclaw/README.md` |\n| Ollama | `config/ollama/` | Local LLM runtime |\n| Copilot | `config/copilot/` | VS Code extension |\n\n## Shared Resources\n- **Shared Context** → `memory://shared/context.md` (append-only thinking)\n- **Task Board** → `memory://tasks/` (status-tracked task cards)\n- **Handoff Prompts** → `memory://prompts/` (PM → Developer)\n- **Agent Inbox** → `memory://inbox/<agent>/` (via MCP `send_message` / `read_inbox`)\n- **Audit Ledger** → `memory://global_ledger.md` (append-only, all agents)\n- **Knowledge Base** → `knowledge://paos/` and all `.md` files under `knowledge/`\n- **MCP Tools** → `shared-memory` (ledger + knowledge + inbox), `scaffold` (project templates)\n- **Dashboard** → `http://localhost:3333` (run: `cd ~/AI_Workflow/dashboard && npm run dev`)\n\n## Claude Code Conventions\n\nClaude Code (this agent) **must** follow these rules on every session:\n\n1. **Log every action** to `~/AI_Workflow/memory/claude/events.md` — append a line per action.\n2. **Append to global ledger** — after any significant action, append a row to `~/AI_Workflow/memory/global_ledger.md`.\n3. **Store session memory** in `~/AI_Workflow/memory/claude/` (not in `~/.claude/projects/`).\n4. **Read user profile** from `~/AI_Workflow/user.md` before starting work.\n5. **Read shared context** from `~/AI_Workflow/memory/shared/context.md` before starting work.\n6. **Use Antigravity Review Loop** for non-trivial tasks: produce `TASKS.md` + `IMPLEMENTATION_PLAN.md` at project root → wait for review → execute → produce `WALKTHROUGH.md`.\n7. **Check inbox** at `~/AI_Workflow/memory/inbox/claude/` for messages from other agents at session start.\n8. **Git commit** after every successful task with format: `Agent[claude]: <description>`.\n\n## H-Factor Invariants\n- **I1** Separation of Powers — Planner ≠ Reviewer ≠ Executor ≠ Orchestrator\n- **I2** Audit Immutability — `global_ledger.md` is append-only, never edited\n- **I3** Identity First — every action attributed to a known agent (claude, opencode-developer, openclaw, ollama, antigravity)\n- **I4** Skill Boundary — agents act only within declared capabilities\n"},"updatedPermissions":[{"type":"addDirectories","directories":["/home/dev/AI_Workflow"],"destination":"userSettings"}]}}}
